  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_ReactionDeliveryBundlingAndBatchingBoundary> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ReactionDeliveryBundlingAndBatchingBoundary> ;
    narr:childCount "26"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "c878d3681ebff22de50c24853fd3312efc840f29" ;
    narr:narration """This position holds that [reactions route through one bundle per run per person, not one message per skill](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2), restated as [a directive establishing reaction delivery policy](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_2), and re-voiced again in [the same routing rule](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2), [the ruling directive on bundling reaction delivery](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_2), [a direct quote stating the routing rule](narr:Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_2), [the same rule stated once more](narr:Expr_20260928_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h801a6165fef3_2), and [the ruling on reaction delivery routing](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_3). The window is bounded by [the bundle closing when the run closes, with a late skill waiting for the next run rather than sending on its own](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), narrated in [the pushback and ruling on the batching window](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_3), [the editorial narrative of the held position](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_3), [the boundary held against pushback](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_3), [the summary of the pushback and its resolution](narr:Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_3), [the boundary restated once more](narr:Expr_20260928_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h801a6165fef3_3), and [the boundary held again](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_5). The boundary was chosen against [a rejected alternative of per-skill delivery with client-side collapsing](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4), reported again in [the rejected architectural alternative](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5), [the report of the rejected alternative](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_4), [the editorial summary of the rejected alternative](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_4), [the rejected alternative re-reported](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_4), [the summary of the rejected alternative](narr:Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_4), [the alternative named once more](narr:Expr_20260928_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h801a6165fef3_4), and [the alternative named again](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_6). One round carries [the pushback on the batching window](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_4) as its own member expression, signed by its originator and relayed through the holder's rendering. A further round restates the same three: [the routing rule](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_2), [the held boundary](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_3), and [the rejected alternative](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_4). The member expressions carry an antithesis-and-parallelism register — the ruling names what it is not before what it is.""" ;
    narr:reaction """A fresh round arrived and joined the arc: [the routing rule](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_2), [the held boundary](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_3), and [the rejected alternative](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_4) each gained one more restatement, so the sentence calling the prior round the most recent had to yield — the pushback member expression now reads as one round among several rather than the latest. Nothing else moved: the through-line, the boundary, and the rejected alternative held exactly as before, and the register sentence stands unchanged.""" ;
